{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13551","headline":"徐侍郎素未相识时携酒命馔兼命诸诗客同访会稽山居 · 秦系","name":"徐侍郎素未相识时携酒命馔兼命诸诗客同访会稽山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽道仙翁至，幽人学拜迎。\n华簪窥瓮牖，珍味代藜羹。\n洗砚鱼仍戏，移樽鸟不惊。\n兰亭攀叙却，会此越中营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}